### Node ###
node_modules/

# LLM tool configuration is a personal/workstation concern, never a plugin
# artifact. The RRZE LLM specification requires these to live only in each
# developer's global tool config (e.g. ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md) and explicitly
# forbids duplicating the RRZE standard into a per-plugin copy
# (LLM-Spezifikation-Dauerhafte-Anweisungen.md). A project-local file is
# only ever allowed for genuine plugin-specific instructions, never as a
# place to store or mirror the standard — and even then it stays out of
# this repository unless the team explicitly decides otherwise.
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
GEMINI.md
.cursor/rules/

# Local IDE / OS artifacts
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Local environment / credentials — never commit these regardless
.env
.env.*
wp-config-local.php

# Logs, temp, coverage
*.log
*.tmp
/coverage/
